      "name": "Dr. B. Janet",
      "role": "Staff Advisor",
      "image": "/Assets/team/staff_advisor.jpg",
      "message": "Version has always been more than just a technical fest; it's a celebration of ideas and innovation. The team has worked tirelessly to curate events that challenge and inspire.\n\nI wish all the participants the very best. May this event spark new ideas and forge lasting connections in our technical community."
    }
